    "body": "@AmeliaBR it seems better to get to the bottom of those inconsistencies and fix those. Do you have web-platform-tests?\r\n\r\n`object` and `embed` are extremely special in how they behave with respect to containing a browsing context, image, or plugin. Adding functionality on top of them would be ill-advised I think.",
