    "created_at": "2017-04-08T06:12:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-08T06:12:05Z",
    "body": "That would only make sense if folks are still investing in plugin architecture and if plugin architecture was standardized. Neither of those is the case so any such effort would be in vain.",
