    "created_at": "2017-04-10T13:21:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-10T13:21:50Z",
    "body": "I believe Flash does not support sandbox restrictions. So the only way to make sure Flash does not escape your sandbox is to disallow Flash from running in the first place.\r\n\r\nNot sure what the situation is like for PDF.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
